{% comment %}
  Theme-owned replacement copy for /policies/refund-policy.
  Keeps Shopify policy classes so the shared policy layout remains unchanged.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="shopify-policy__container">
  <div class="shopify-policy__title">
    <h1>Return / Exchange Guidelines</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="shopify-policy__body">
    <div class="rte">
      <p>We want you to love your Fourth Wink piece. If something is not quite right, you can request a return or exchange under the conditions below.</p>

      <h2>Return &amp; Exchange Conditions</h2>
      <p>Return or exchange requests must be made within 14 days of receiving your order.</p>
      <p>To be eligible, items must be:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Unused, unworn, and in their original condition</li>
        <li>Returned with all original tags and labels attached</li>
        <li>Returned in their original packaging, such as the dust bag, box, or any protective packaging</li>
        <li>Accompanied by proof of purchase, such as your order or invoice number</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Items that do not meet these conditions may be sent back to you, and any related shipping costs may be deducted from your refund.</p>

      <h2>Request a Return or Exchange</h2>
      <p>To request a return or exchange, please email us within 14 days of receiving your order at:</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:support@fourthwink.com">support@fourthwink.com</a></p>
      <p>Please include your exact order number and a short explanation of your request.</p>
      <p>Our customer care team will get back to you within 2&ndash;3 business days.</p>
      <p>Once your request is confirmed, a pickup may be scheduled. Please note that an additional shipping fee may apply depending on your location.</p>
      <p>Returns and exchanges are currently available for orders delivered within Cairo only. You can contact our customer care team anytime to check the status of your return.</p>

      <h2>Refunds</h2>
      <p>Once your returned item is received, it will be inspected by our quality team.</p>
      <p>If the return is accepted, your refund will be processed through the same payment method used for the original order.</p>
      <p>Please note:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Original shipping fees are non-refundable</li>
        <li>Return shipping fees may be deducted from your refund</li>
        <li>Refunds may take 4&ndash;15 business days, depending on your payment provider</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Exchanges</h2>
      <p>Once your return is accepted and the item is confirmed to be unused, unworn, and in its original packaging, we will process your exchange within 3&ndash;4 business days.</p>
      <p>Please note that the customer is responsible for any new shipping charges related to the exchange.</p>

      <h2>Before Dispatch</h2>
      <p>If you would like to cancel or change your order before it has been shipped, please contact our customer care team as soon as possible at:</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:support@fourthwink.com">support@fourthwink.com</a></p>
      <p>Once an order has been dispatched, it can no longer be cancelled and will need to follow the regular return or exchange process.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
